        48.495,
        719.865,
        621.3149999999998,
        735.75
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "id": "paragraph.0",
      "text": "hottest of the eight planets.",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.38,
        741.865,
        239.83500000000004,
        757.75
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "id": "paragraph.1",
      "text": "Return to ocean-covered Earth, then travel outward to Mars. Its red color comes from",
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 15,
      "bounds": [
        49.515,
        775.865,
        639.285,
        790.85
      ]
    },
